{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body><p>更新時間：14:18 2026-10-07 HKT<br/>發佈時間：14:18 2026-10-07 HKT</p>\n<p>發佈時間：14:18 2026-10-07 HKT</p><p>東涌有工人墮斃。今日（7日）下午1時42分警方接報，指匯東街近翔東邨一建築地盤內，一名30多歲男工人由高處墮下，跌落平台，不省人事。救援人員趕往現場救援，其後男工人被送往北大嶼山醫院搶救，惜終告不治。勞工處人員其後到場，調查意外原因。</p><img alt=\"現場為匯東街一地盤。梁國峰攝\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/9d1fec33cb538c43f210c4d4b4e8e2b7/2026-10/WhatsApp_Image_2026-10-07_at_15_23_18.jpeg\"/><img alt=\"現場為匯東街一地盤。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/dbfbf2ebd9d4a8545a9b5be0d6437a87/2026-10/WhatsApp_Image_2026-10-07_at_15_23_17.jpeg\"/><img alt=\"現場為匯東街一地盤。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/6bd2b4df8e36c80ab761e5f37f2276ae/2026-10/WhatsApp_Image_2026-10-07_at_15_23_14_1_.jpeg\"/><img alt=\"警員到場調查。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/97158d69e77287faf10ee668725137bb/2026-10/WhatsApp_Image_2026-10-07_at_15_23_12.jpeg\"/><img alt=\"警員到場調查。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/199e8690653797109ac815fa22f74500/2026-10/WhatsApp_Image_2026-10-07_at_15_23_13.jpeg\"/><img alt=\"懷疑勞工處人員到場調查。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/5cc5beaf33ede9cd1998d3ed60508034/2026-10/WhatsApp_Image_2026-10-07_at_15_23_14.jpeg\"/><img alt=\"懷疑勞工處人員到場調查。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/dbee679de83c6092eb7ea6bfea2ef267/2026-10/WhatsApp_Image_2026-10-07_at_15_23_16.jpeg\"/><p>最Hit</p>\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-07T07:59:00.443082+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":200,"images":7,"source":"星島頭條","fallback":"none"}}